subject: Add an option to open DevTools in a new tab

A "New tab" checkbox in More tools opens Developer tools and Inspect as a tab next to
the inspected page instead of a separate window, like Kiwi Browser. Toggling it keeps
the menu open, and checkbox rows without an icon line up with the other menu rows.
---
